Description: Secure browser-based remote access
 Self-hosted remote access platform: browser VNC through noVNC,
 a web terminal, health monitoring, HTTPS/TLS, ephemeral shareable
 remote sessions with RBAC, MFA, rate limiting and hash-chained
 audit logging. Unified Python CLI (vnc-remote).
